OL,3,GNEWSAChallenging a 'throw-away culture'
OL,4,Ain cancer care
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who runs a cancer charity which
OL,7,Fcollects headscarves and chemotherapy
OL,8,Fwear has said she wants to make the
OL,9,Fitems accessible for everyone.
OL,11,FJo Knight, from Dover, set up
OL,12,FPreloved-Reloved five years ago
OL,13,Ffollowing her own diagnosis of breast
OL,14,Fcancer in 2017.
OL,16,FAfter her diagnosis, Knight had a
OL,17,Fdouble mastectomy and chemotherapy,
OL,18,Fwhich left her with persistent
OL,19,Fchemotherapy induced alopecia (CIA).
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
